1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,927
A Hard Trip.
艰难的旅程。

2
00:00:02,927 --> 00:00:43,587
My sister was fond of traveling. Ever since graduating, she had been determined to organize a trip to an old temple. Since the transport fare was expensive, she decided to use a bicycle to cycle there not caring about the disadvantages.
我姐姐很喜欢旅行。从毕业起，她就决心组织一次前往古庙的旅行。由于交通费用昂贵，她决定骑自行车过去，并不在乎这种方式的缺点。

3
00:00:43,587 --> 00:01:16,913
Her stubborn attitude was always her shortcoming. Once she made up her mind to do something, no one could persuade her to change her mind. Finally, we gave in as usual though we preferred to take a train.
固执一直是她的缺点。一旦她下定决心做某事，就没人能说服她改变主意。最后，我们像往常一样让步了，尽管我们更想坐火车。

4
00:01:16,913 --> 00:02:05,073
After we prepared everything, including the schedule, reliable weather forecast and the insurance, we began our trip. Our journey was along a river flowing from a high altitude. Our pace was slow because the river frequently had many sharp bends through deep valleys, where the water seemed to boil.
准备好一切之后，包括行程表，可靠的天气预报和保险，我们踏上了旅程。我们沿着一条从高海拔地区流下来的河流前进。行进的速度很慢，因为河道常常急转弯，穿过深深的山谷，那里的水仿佛在沸腾。

5
00:02:05,073 --> 00:02:37,833
Just as I recorded in my journal, it was really a hard journey. But we also enjoyed great views. One night, I put my head on my pillow--a parcel of wool coats, and lay beneath the stars.
正如我在日记里记下的，这确实是一次艰难的旅行。但我们也欣赏到了壮丽的风景。一天晚上，我把头枕在枕头上——那是一包羊毛外套，躺在星空之下。

6
00:02:37,833 --> 00:02:50,427
When the flame in front of our cave went out at midnight, I found the sky so beautiful!
午夜时，我们洞穴前的火熄灭了，我发现天空竟然如此美丽！
